# The names the directories that install whatever they find (app, info, ai)
# pass over, one find -name pattern each, in one place so a name to leave out
# is added here and not in every walk.
#
# Makefile* for the ones make and automake leave lying about in a build inside
# the source tree; *.orig and *.rej for the ones a patch that did not apply
# cleanly leaves beside its target, which would otherwise be gzipped onto the
# box and copied into the archive.
#
# The patterns reach find unexpanded (the walks turn globbing off first), so a
# pattern may hold * and ? but not a space.
exclude_files = \
	Makefile* \
	*.orig \
	*.rej
